    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16062" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρωμᾰτ-ίζω</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰρ],</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>spice,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στέαρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					1.66
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				2.76.10
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠρωματις μένον ἔλαιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Inscr.Prien.</u>
