				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(i B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			intr., <i>have a spicy flavour</i> or <i>scent,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
